    "summary": "Customer received chicken curry instead of the tofu curry (item K-9101-1, $14.50) on order K-9101 from Spice Route, placed 2026-10-24 17:40 PT, handed over 18:20. Order falls within open incident INC-311 (recalled curry sauce batch, orders 17:00-19:00). Customer has not eaten any of it and reports no illness. Needs compensation through the incident team."
