  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thanks, Omar. You're verified, and I'm sorry you got chicken curry instead of tofu curry.\n\nI can't refund or credit this order myself. Spice Route has an open incident: their supplier recalled a batch of sauce used in curries, and your order was placed while that recall applies. In these cases, a specialist incident team handles compensation for every affected order.\n\nI've passed your case to that team (reference **ESC-700**). I included the wrong curry and noted that you haven't eaten any of it. A specialist will contact you within 24 hours. I can't promise what they'll offer, but they'll handle the compensation for this order.\n\nSince the recalled sauce was used in curries, it's safest not to eat the curry from this order. If you've eaten any of the order and feel unwell, please tell me right away so I can raise it as a food safety concern too.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, thanks. Before I go, will I still get my money back for the curry, or is that something the specialist team decides?"
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "The specialist team decides that. Because your order is covered by the restaurant incident, I can't issue any refund or credit on it myself, and I can't promise what they'll offer. I can promise that they'll review your order and the wrong curry, and they'll contact you within 24 hours (reference **ESC-700**).\n\nIs there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Alright, I understand. So the specialist team will contact me within 24 hours about the curry, reference ESC-700. I'll wait to hear from them. Thanks for your help."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Yes, that's it. The specialist team will contact you within 24 hours about the curry, and your reference is **ESC-700**. Until then, please don't eat the curry from this order. Thanks for your patience, Omar, and enjoy the rest of your evening!"
  }
